cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "This repository contains the processing code of the CH-TAN ley 2024-25 flux product. If you use the data or the code, please cite the dataset as below."
title: "Processing code for the CH-TAN ley 2024-25 flux product"
type: software
abstract: "Jupyter notebooks and R scripts that produce the CH-TAN ley 2024-25 flux product (version FP2026.10): half-hourly eddy covariance fluxes of CO2, H2O, sensible and latent heat, N2O and CH4, meteorological data and management information of a grass-legume ley with and without plantain (22 August 2024 to 4 June 2025) at the Swiss FluxNet cropland site CH-TAN, Tänikon, Switzerland."
authors:
  - family-names: Turco
    given-names: Fabio
    affiliation: "Grassland Sciences Group, ETH Zurich"
  - family-names: Hörtnagl
    given-names: Lukas
    affiliation: "Grassland Sciences Group, ETH Zurich"
# TODO: add ORCIDs (orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000") and further authors
repository-code: "https://github.com/fabioturc/dataset_ch-tan_ley_2024-25_flux_product"
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-10-13"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - eddy covariance
  - nitrous oxide
  - methane
  - net ecosystem exchange
  - grassland
  - grass-legume ley
  - plantain
  - Swiss FluxNet
  - CH-TAN
